  // Repeatedly sweep the family's queues until a full pass admits nothing.
  // Within each pass older requests are considered first; a request that
  // does not fit is skipped so it cannot block later requests that do,
  // but while any older request is still queued it keeps the first pick on
  // every later pass, which guarantees it is never starved.
  function drainFamily(now) {
